    body: `<p>At Kep the crab is kept live in baskets or on ice, and that is what you want to buy. Look for <strong>movement</strong> and a firm, intact shell — a sluggish or damaged crab is past its best. A heavier crab for its size usually means more meat, so compare weight, not just how big it looks.</p>`,
